  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, deeper-issue investigation): This item and WI-kutam describe the identical bug (slice.py:153 error template suggests --language unconditionally, regardless of whether the candidate set splits by language). The reproduction in INV-nugos (cli:main matches two python files) and in WI-kutam (find_files matches real + synthetic-unresolved, both python) are the same mechanism with different candidate-set shapes. Marking this one as the duplicate; WI-kutam stays canonical. Fix lives in AmbiguousEntryError.__init__ to branch on len({c.language for c in candidates})."  # 294f
